{"steam_appid":3640200,"steam_name":"Dawson Oaks Trailer Park","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640200/1822072904/4065b47f261ec1e08de3c4b9171ffcfe418d271c/1776330364/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776358025","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257316133/3e2281d4f9b3b02d433f8d235939c945ed593493/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776358025","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/ae388b4f042dbdf09358da55b2fa0d315b2293ca/ss_ae388b4f042dbdf09358da55b2fa0d315b2293ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789830536","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/43b5980572008735ac13583edf4b4f55ccb102d4/ss_43b5980572008735ac13583edf4b4f55ccb102d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789830536","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/970f7a9f31530de8d8a92e4b95b5d82c0c7258d6/ss_970f7a9f31530de8d8a92e4b95b5d82c0c7258d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789830536","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/6fd9bd9f179de84fbb7d8724ba07e68fd6c4dbf7/ss_6fd9bd9f179de84fbb7d8724ba07e68fd6c4dbf7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789830536","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/4057f42b30f4f98e60b8f00cadccdd7327e88ddd/ss_4057f42b30f4f98e60b8f00cadccdd7327e88ddd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789830536"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUSPECTS </strong>(11 Unique Roles) <br><br>Do your crimes. Work together. Don't be too obvious</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit your role-specific urges to stay sane, but don’t make it obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you wait, the more unstable you become… and the easier it is for others to expose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspect roles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug Dealer, Junkie, Moonshine Cook, Creep, Scrapper, Pyromaniac, Gambler, Thief, Drunk, Prankster, Hobo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.poster.avif?t=1789830536\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.webm?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.mp4?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPERVISOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch everyone. Figure out who’s doing what, and call the police before it’s too late. Call the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget. You only have power if you have information...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.poster.avif?t=1789830536\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.webm?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.mp4?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNITCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in as a suspect, track everyone’s behavior, and secretly report everything to the Supervisor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know more than anyone else.<br>But if they figure out who you are, you’re done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.poster.avif?t=1789830536\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.webm?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.mp4?t=1789830536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEETINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, the suspects can call a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone gathers, pretends to be friendly…<br>and votes on who they think the Snitch is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get it wrong, and the real Snitch stays hidden.<br>Get it right, and the suspects take control.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1080Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Striped Panda Studios"],"publishers":["Striped Panda Studios"],"release_date":"Sep 17, 2026"}